MIT License

Copyright (c) 2026 x3utils-esp32 contributors

This project is an ESP32 port derived from x3utils (https://github.com/ztakis/x3utils,
MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 ztakis) and its bundled swdart engine (MIT, Copyright (c)
2026 nopbxlr). The AT32F415 flash/SWD algorithm and the firmware-identity and
SHU-compatibility safety gates are ported from those projects; the bit-banged
SWD transport, the WiFi web server, and the browser UI are new.

